        <title type="html"><![CDATA[Add retriable module loading keys]]></title>
        <id>https://github.com/mdn/browser-compat-data/pull/30604</id>
        <link href="https://github.com/mdn/browser-compat-data/pull/30604"/>
        <updated>2026-09-21T16:46:03.000Z</updated>
        <content type="html"><![CDATA[<img src="https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/64103?u=428d3c27c9cd7efc648e17dfe5a4321c3f8e44d2&v=4" width="64" height="64" alt=""/><br/><h4 dir="auto">Summary</h4>
<p dir="auto">Add some keys representing a new behavior in module loading, where HTTP errors aren't cached, so developers can now retry loading a module that failed to fetch.</p>

<h4 dir="auto">Test results and supporting details</h4>
<p dir="auto">This is a spec change and (I think) one that is impossible to feature detect, so this makes a good fit for a behavioral subfeature.</p>
<p dir="auto">I didn't test this, but it's well attested through bugs:</p>
<ul dir="auto">
<li>Chromium <a href="https://chromiumdash.appspot.com/commit/bef695c64ce4914a752c8d9e61ca1ddf62368d85" rel="nofollow">enabled it in 156</a> (<a href="https://issues.chromium.org/issues/534781954" rel="nofollow">tracking bug</a>).</li>
<li>WebKit added it with <a href="https://commits.webkit.org/319474@main" rel="nofollow">r319474</a>. The Safari TP release notes don't mention it by name, but it was included in <a href="https://webkit.org/blog/18304/release-notes-for-safari-technology-preview-252/#:~:text=This%20release%20includes%20WebKit%20changes%20between" rel="nofollow">the range of changes given by the 252 release notes</a>. When I tried <a href="https://wpt.live/html/semantics/scripting-1/the-script-element/module/dynamic-import/repeated-imports.any.html" rel="nofollow">the WPT test</a> on Safari 27, it failed.</li>
<li><a href="https://bugzilla.mozilla.org/show_bug.cgi?id=2055211" title="Don't cache HTTP errors in the module map" rel="nofollow">Firefox bug 2055211</a> shows this shipping in 154.</li>
</ul>
<p dir="auto">Setting the spec URL was difficult. There's nothing in the spec that screams that this should work the way it does, but you can see <a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="2283078060" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/whatwg/html/issues/10327" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/whatwg/html/pull/10327/hovercard" href="https://github.com/whatwg/html/pull/10327">whatwg/html#10327</a> and tell me if you've got a better idea here.</p>
<p dir="auto">Lastly, I added three keys since I believe these are the three entry points for this behavior. See <a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="5226263705" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/mdn/browser-compat-data/issues/30304" data-hovercard-type="issue" data-hovercard-url="/mdn/browser-compat-data/issues/30304/hovercard" href="https://github.com/mdn/browser-compat-data/issues/30304">#30304</a> for further discussion.</p>


<h4 dir="auto">Related issues</h4>
<ul dir="auto">
<li><span class="issue-keyword tooltipped tooltipped-se" aria-label="This pull request closes issue #30304.">Fixes</span> <a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="5226263705" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/mdn/browser-compat-data/issues/30304" data-hovercard-type="issue" data-hovercard-url="/mdn/browser-compat-data/issues/30304/hovercard" href="https://github.com/mdn/browser-compat-data/issues/30304">#30304</a></li>
<li>Prompted by <a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="5411824149" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/web-platform-dx/web-features/issues/4335" data-hovercard-type="issue" data-hovercard-url="/web-platform-dx/web-features/issues/4335/hovercard" href="https://github.com/web-platform-dx/web-features/issues/4335">web-platform-dx/web-features#4335</a></li>
<li>Spec change: <a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="2283078060" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/whatwg/html/issues/10327" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/whatwg/html/pull/10327/hovercard" href="https://github.com/whatwg/html/pull/10327">whatwg/html#10327</a></li>
</ul>

]]></content>
