        <title type="html"><![CDATA[Add HTML `<textarea wrap>` values]]></title>
        <id>https://github.com/mdn/browser-compat-data/pull/30550</id>
        <link href="https://github.com/mdn/browser-compat-data/pull/30550"/>
        <updated>2026-09-18T20:57:43.000Z</updated>
        <content type="html"><![CDATA[<img src="https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/495429?u=9d0bf7e5c07194485c7f81827005599ecced9712&v=4" width="64" height="64" alt=""/><br/><h4 dir="auto">Summary</h4>
<p dir="auto">Add compatibility data for the <code class="notranslate">soft</code> and <code class="notranslate">off</code> values of the HTML <code class="notranslate">&lt;textarea wrap&gt;</code> attribute.</p>
<p dir="auto">The parent <code class="notranslate">wrap</code> support data is broadened where needed so it covers both values.</p>
<h4 dir="auto">Test results and supporting details</h4>
<p dir="auto">The <code class="notranslate">soft</code> value is standard-track and the <code class="notranslate">off</code> value is non-standard.</p>
<ul dir="auto">
<li>Chrome (<code class="notranslate">16</code>), Edge (<code class="notranslate">12</code>), Firefox (<code class="notranslate">4</code>), Opera (<code class="notranslate">≤12.1</code>), and Safari (<code class="notranslate">6</code>) reuse the existing <code class="notranslate">wrap</code> versions for both values.</li>
<li>Internet Explorer uses <code class="notranslate">≤4</code> for <code class="notranslate">wrap</code>, <code class="notranslate">off</code>, and <code class="notranslate">soft</code>, based on Microsoft's historical <a href="https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/previous-versions/office/developer/office-2003/aa221078%28v%3Doffice.11%29" rel="nofollow"><code class="notranslate">IHTMLTextAreaElement.wrap</code></a> documentation.</li>
</ul>
<h4 dir="auto">Related issues</h4>
<p dir="auto"><span class="issue-keyword tooltipped tooltipped-se" aria-label="This pull request closes issue #24413.">Fixes</span> <a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="2517003732" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/mdn/browser-compat-data/issues/24413" data-hovercard-type="issue" data-hovercard-url="/mdn/browser-compat-data/issues/24413/hovercard" href="https://github.com/mdn/browser-compat-data/issues/24413">#24413</a></p>]]></content>
